#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:136
msgid "&Save image comments as embedded text"
msgstr "រក្សា​ទុក​សេចក្ដី​អធិប្បាយ​ជា​អត្ថបទ​បង្កប់"

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:137
