msgstr "<p>សូម​ជ្រើស​ថត​ម៉ាស៊ីនថត ដែល​អ្នក​ចង់​ផ្ទុក​រូបភាព​ឡើង ។</p>"

#: utilities/cameragui/renamecustomizer.cpp:141
msgid "Camera filenames"
msgstr "ឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារ​ម៉ាស៊ីនថត"

#: utilities/cameragui/renamecustomizer.cpp:142
msgid ""
"<p>Turn on this option to use camera provided image filenames without "
